(6872323, 1035306, 80706, '<td valign="top">I feel like this would make a nice black and white and would like if the depth of field let the background fall off some.</td>', 'I feel like this would make a nice black and white and would like if the depth of field let the background fall off some.', '2012-10-01 02:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
