(6872439, 1035698, 137576, '<td valign="top">for me this top and the models disinterested look dont help this, the top is persnal taste but from a fashion shoot point of view i dislike the off the shoulder and the hand position, the back of her arm on show as well is not appealing. the light is flat and the eyes dull. the eyes should always pop. you need mopre contrast in your light, have a key light and a fill light set at different power. also the other arm that we can only see a bit of, whats it there for waht it doing needs to be moving or seen more. my guess would be first  time model.</td>', 'for me this top and the models disinterested look dont help this, the top is persnal taste but from a fashion shoot point of view i dislike the off the shoulder and the hand position, the back of her arm on show as well is not appealing. the light is flat and the eyes dull. the eyes should always pop. you need mopre contrast in your light, have a key light and a fill light set at different power. also the other arm that we can only see a bit of, whats it there for waht it doing needs to be moving or seen more. my guess would be first  time model.', '2012-10-01 04:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
