(6873250, 1035594, 112828, '<td valign="top">YAMTI! (Yet another muddy tonemapped image)...  Sorry, but there is a glut of muddy tonemapped images in this freestudy, this is really a rather sad one for me, as the image is nice, good composition, nice location, great fall colors, but it all falls flat because of the processing...  At least this is one of the best of the YAMTI.</td>', 'YAMTI! (Yet another muddy tonemapped image)...  Sorry, but there is a glut of muddy tonemapped images in this freestudy, this is really a rather sad one for me, as the image is nice, good composition, nice location, great fall colors, but it all falls flat because of the processing...  At least this is one of the best of the YAMTI.', '2012-10-02 00:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
