(6874076, 1035552, 94134, '<td valign="top">Dont I wish I could go on safari and get these cool shots! Nice shot.</td>', 'Dont I wish I could go on safari and get these cool shots! Nice shot.', '2012-10-03 01:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6874089, 1034376, 94134, '<td valign="top">Great shot, great backdrop, great pose, great model....basically everything works but there is one huge thing thats bothering me and and its the OUTFIT.  It seem so awkward and that is doesnt belong.  Everyhting else on her seems to work perfectly with the background (like the feathers and bracelets and headband), all very "fall-ish" but that outfit I just dont get. I just wish she was wearing something more apealing, or simply wearing....more.  It wont change my vote! I still like everything about it, except that.</td>', 'Great shot, great backdrop, great pose, great model....basically everything works but there is one huge thing thats bothering me and and its the OUTFIT.  It seem so awkward and that is doesnt belong.  Everyhting else on her seems to work perfectly with the background (like the feathers and bracelets and headband), all very "fall-ish" but that outfit I just dont get. I just wish she was wearing something more apealing, or simply wearing....more.  It wont change my vote! I still like everything about it, except that.', '2012-10-03 01:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6874090, 1035335, 94134, '<td valign="top">Eerie river, like the purple.</td>', 'Eerie river, like the purple.', '2012-10-03 01:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6874097, 1035428, 94134, '<td valign="top">Read the title, looked at the photo for a bit, thought of my score.  At the last second I saw the small white goat there and automatically bumped my score!  Didnt get it at first but then that little guy made all the difference to me.  I proabably shouldnt sit so close to the screen! Well done!</td>', 'Read the title, looked at the photo for a bit, thought of my score.  At the last second I saw the small white goat there and automatically bumped my score!  Didnt get it at first but then that little guy made all the difference to me.  I proabably shouldnt sit so close to the screen! Well done!', '2012-10-03 01:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
