(6874115, 1035841, 94134, '<td valign="top">Great set up.  The lighting seems to be coming from underneath her?  How did you manage that when it seems shes sitting on the floor because of the way her legs are so spread out?  Id love to know how, id love to use such a lighting technique.  I hope this gets up there in score, but know this community, some will find this distasteful.  Its borderline, however I think its a well done nude.  Great job.</td>', 'Great set up.  The lighting seems to be coming from underneath her?  How did you manage that when it seems shes sitting on the floor because of the way her legs are so spread out?  Id love to know how, id love to use such a lighting technique.  I hope this gets up there in score, but know this community, some will find this distasteful.  Its borderline, however I think its a well done nude.  Great job.', '2012-10-03 02:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
