(6876544, 1032844, 25190, '<td valign="top">I feel there is  a few thing a wrong with this image for one there is too much negative space it could have been cropped better which would have brought the fly out more i think the subject is too central with in the image using the rule of the third would help here  the lighting seems very harsh on the subject I hope my comment has been constructive ..Hope too see more of your work</td>', 'I feel there is  a few thing a wrong with this image for one there is too much negative space it could have been cropped better which would have brought the fly out more i think the subject is too central with in the image using the rule of the third would help here  the lighting seems very harsh on the subject I hope my comment has been constructive ..Hope too see more of your work', '2012-10-05 14:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
