(6876548, 1035628, 25190, '<td valign="top">If you have a look at some of the image in this challenge you,ll where you went wrong looking at your image its very unteresting alot of your image is out of focus excepted for the foreground and its not very sharp the lighting really hurts this image as well very harsh i hope you take these comments as constructive and use them too help further your photography ..good luck</td>', 'If you have a look at some of the image in this challenge you,ll where you went wrong looking at your image its very unteresting alot of your image is out of focus excepted for the foreground and its not very sharp the lighting really hurts this image as well very harsh i hope you take these comments as constructive and use them too help further your photography ..good luck', '2012-10-05 14:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876551, 1032869, 25190, '<td valign="top">Well my first thoughts when i saw this image was i hope your whole camera didnt get wet and its just your lens..Not sure what your image is about i,m trying too find an interesting point but i seem too be loss. Not a very good image in my view for a FS i think you should check some image here and get an idea of what you need too focus on ..Good luck</td>', 'Well my first thoughts when i saw this image was i hope your whole camera didnt get wet and its just your lens..Not sure what your image is about i,m trying too find an interesting point but i seem too be loss. Not a very good image in my view for a FS i think you should check some image here and get an idea of what you need too focus on ..Good luck', '2012-10-05 14:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876562, 1034792, 67258, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually take any notice of titles, and believe many photos benefit from being untitled - this one is probably an exception!  The dichotomy between the rather wan and sad looking child, her delicate celebration dress and the dying rose mounted on barbed wire is obvious, but it''s meaning somewhat elusive.  A photo to intrigue and return to again.  Technicals can''t be faulted.</td>', 'I don''t usually take any notice of titles, and believe many photos benefit from being untitled - this one is probably an exception!  The dichotomy between the rather wan and sad looking child, her delicate celebration dress and the dying rose mounted on barbed wire is obvious, but it''s meaning somewhat elusive.  A photo to intrigue and return to again.  Technicals can''t be faulted.', '2012-10-05 15:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876564, 1035527, 67258, '<td valign="top">The odd grey of the sky, typical of tone-mapping detract - you might like to consider a crop at the top of the arch of bridge, a stronger image to my mind.</td>', 'The odd grey of the sky, typical of tone-mapping detract - you might like to consider a crop at the top of the arch of bridge, a stronger image to my mind.', '2012-10-05 15:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876566, 1033620, 67258, '<td valign="top">Cracking composition, and superb timing.  Really well seen.</td>', 'Cracking composition, and superb timing.  Really well seen.', '2012-10-05 15:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876568, 1035520, 67258, '<td valign="top">I find the lack of depth to this somewhat disconcerting.  Although you have used a small aperture and there is clearly a very deep depth of field, your choice of processing has flattened the image to a point that my brain struggles to accept is a photo rather than a painting.  That said, I don''t dislike it, but I feel I would prefer just a lighter touch on the tone-mapping to retain a little more of a photographic feel.  All entirely subjective, and others may love it just as is.</td>', 'I find the lack of depth to this somewhat disconcerting.  Although you have used a small aperture and there is clearly a very deep depth of field, your choice of processing has flattened the image to a point that my brain struggles to accept is a photo rather than a painting.  That said, I don''t dislike it, but I feel I would prefer just a lighter touch on the tone-mapping to retain a little more of a photographic feel.  All entirely subjective, and others may love it just as is.', '2012-10-05 15:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876570, 1035427, 67258, '<td valign="top">These reservoir sink holes always intrigue me, and yes, a portal to another world is just as I think of them.  Your composition combined with the night time exposure and eerie sky add to the feel.</td>', 'These reservoir sink holes always intrigue me, and yes, a portal to another world is just as I think of them.  Your composition combined with the night time exposure and eerie sky add to the feel.', '2012-10-05 15:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876572, 1035552, 67258, '<td valign="top">Oh yes!</td>', 'Oh yes!', '2012-10-05 15:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876574, 1035841, 67258, '<td valign="top">The title is, to me, so much weaker than the image.  A really interesting photograph.</td>', 'The title is, to me, so much weaker than the image.  A really interesting photograph.', '2012-10-05 15:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876577, 1035670, 67258, '<td valign="top">Up there in my top 10 of the challenge.  Particularly like the atmosphere provided by the rising steam.  Some time ago I started a project to photograph snack stands/caravans, but haven''t got far with it yet.</td>', 'Up there in my top 10 of the challenge.  Particularly like the atmosphere provided by the rising steam.  Some time ago I started a project to photograph snack stands/caravans, but haven''t got far with it yet.', '2012-10-05 15:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876581, 1032318, 67258, '<td valign="top">I suspect that you have chosen mono in order to lessen the impact of the burnt highlights on the chest feathers.  A good close up with a complimentary background, but a shame about the exposure.</td>', 'I suspect that you have chosen mono in order to lessen the impact of the burnt highlights on the chest feathers.  A good close up with a complimentary background, but a shame about the exposure.', '2012-10-05 15:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
