(6876936, 1035680, 54446, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and sharpness with great bg bokeh.  This is a Yellow-rumped Warbler, Myrtle subspecies, 1st Winter (Aug-Apr) female.  <i>Dendroica coronata</i> <br/>This is an exceptionally great bird photo.  I love it.  10</td>', 'Excellent detail and sharpness with great bg bokeh.  This is a Yellow-rumped Warbler, Myrtle subspecies, 1st Winter (Aug-Apr) female.  Dendroica coronata This is an exceptionally great bird photo.  I love it.  10', '2012-10-06 09:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876951, 1032507, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Almost Ubique-like in its mood (what could be better); though perhaps a little too ''finished''. The amount of blur on the child is just perfect - a stark contrast to the crispness of the rest of the frame. The toning is great too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: There''s something about the sun that creates the impression of target banding - it distracts a little.<br/> <br/>Overall: I like this very much.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Almost Ubique-like in its mood (what could be better); though perhaps a little too ''finished''. The amount of blur on the child is just perfect - a stark contrast to the crispness of the rest of the frame. The toning is great too. Critical stuff: There''s something about the sun that creates the impression of target banding - it distracts a little. Overall: I like this very much.', '2012-10-06 10:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876953, 1035703, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Wow, look at the light here - I do look at the figure and the lamp post but your leading lines take my eye to those distant high palms with their shadows cutting through the haze - it has a cinematic quality about it.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The figure could do with a little more space to the right.<br/> <br/>Overall: Glorious light, perfectly judged exposure. I like this a lot.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Wow, look at the light here - I do look at the figure and the lamp post but your leading lines take my eye to those distant high palms with their shadows cutting through the haze - it has a cinematic quality about it. Critical stuff: The figure could do with a little more space to the right. Overall: Glorious light, perfectly judged exposure. I like this a lot.', '2012-10-06 10:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876956, 1033713, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: What a fabulous point of view and a stand-out story too. It is understated but still has tons of impact - it''s quite a feat to pull that off. The tones are great as in the composition - again, you break rules, packing the periphery of the image without distracting from your central subject. You make my eye circle the image time and again.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nope.<br/> <br/>Overall: Quite brilliant - looking forward to seeing who this is.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: What a fabulous point of view and a stand-out story too. It is understated but still has tons of impact - it''s quite a feat to pull that off. The tones are great as in the composition - again, you break rules, packing the periphery of the image without distracting from your central subject. You make my eye circle the image time and again. Critical stuff: Nope. Overall: Quite brilliant - looking forward to seeing who this is.', '2012-10-06 10:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876958, 1033856, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I''m get excited very infrequently with landscape work (some DPC''ers pull it off, but not many) and HDR in particular. Here though, you''ve created something highly compelling. Those clouds are amazing and the figures add an overlay of story not often seen in landscape work. The colours too should be gaudy but instead they communicate a rich warmth.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I''m not so keen on the foreground rock - the prominent local contrast in this area delays the eye getting to the much more exciting upper part of the image.<br/> <br/>Overall: Very well crafted. Will do well.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I''m get excited very infrequently with landscape work (some DPC''ers pull it off, but not many) and HDR in particular. Here though, you''ve created something highly compelling. Those clouds are amazing and the figures add an overlay of story not often seen in landscape work. The colours too should be gaudy but instead they communicate a rich warmth. Critical stuff: I''m not so keen on the foreground rock - the prominent local contrast in this area delays the eye getting to the much more exciting upper part of the image. Overall: Very well crafted. Will do well.', '2012-10-06 10:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876963, 1035118, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Perfect POV, super-gorgeous tones and a really interesting subject - has that jagar  sharp but glowy thing going on. I really like the burnt edges too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The foreground track is a bit sharp and crunchy for me; a bit of diffusion in this area might help to keep the eye on the action.<br/> <br/>Overall: An excellent and engaging image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Perfect POV, super-gorgeous tones and a really interesting subject - has that jagar  sharp but glowy thing going on. I really like the burnt edges too. Critical stuff: The foreground track is a bit sharp and crunchy for me; a bit of diffusion in this area might help to keep the eye on the action. Overall: An excellent and engaging image.', '2012-10-06 10:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876965, 1035713, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Great candid capture - excellent contrast in characters that conspires to give a lovely slice of life. I really like the tone of the people and the smile/look of the young lady.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The tones of the background and the chairs are a bit flat; I think I''d have been tempted to boost the contrast a little in those areas. I also think you could chop a bit from the left hand side.<br/> <br/>Overall: This is a fine image that I have enjoyed very much.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Great candid capture - excellent contrast in characters that conspires to give a lovely slice of life. I really like the tone of the people and the smile/look of the young lady. Critical stuff: The tones of the background and the chairs are a bit flat; I think I''d have been tempted to boost the contrast a little in those areas. I also think you could chop a bit from the left hand side. Overall: This is a fine image that I have enjoyed very much.', '2012-10-06 10:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876966, 1035403, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: What a fabulous portrait - full of character. I really like the setting too - those steps give the image a real sense of depth. Tones are pretty much perfect for this shot.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: That is a great door, but I think a composition that cropped just this side of the door, putting him bottom right of the image might have worked better - not least because your marvellous subject would be a bit larger on the screen.<br/> <br/>Overall: Despite my suggestion of a different crop - yours does work and I DO like this image a great deal.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: What a fabulous portrait - full of character. I really like the setting too - those steps give the image a real sense of depth. Tones are pretty much perfect for this shot. Critical stuff: That is a great door, but I think a composition that cropped just this side of the door, putting him bottom right of the image might have worked better - not least because your marvellous subject would be a bit larger on the screen. Overall: Despite my suggestion of a different crop - yours does work and I DO like this image a great deal.', '2012-10-06 10:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876968, 1035348, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: I like the bi-zonal effect here, the prominent foreground gentleman draws the eye but only for a moment before our gaze is hijacked by the officious interloper at the top. He breaks (and won''t permit) us to share in the man''s apparent quiet. I not often brave enough to go with a Dutch angle but it works really well here, anchored as it is by the verticals of the bench. I like your title too - I''m not sure I see suffering here though discomfort perhaps.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: No.<br/> <br/>Overall: A very well made (and intriguing) image.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: I like the bi-zonal effect here, the prominent foreground gentleman draws the eye but only for a moment before our gaze is hijacked by the officious interloper at the top. He breaks (and won''t permit) us to share in the man''s apparent quiet. I not often brave enough to go with a Dutch angle but it works really well here, anchored as it is by the verticals of the bench. I like your title too - I''m not sure I see suffering here though discomfort perhaps. Critical stuff: No. Overall: A very well made (and intriguing) image.', '2012-10-06 11:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876971, 1035104, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Astonishing portrait. I wouldn''t want to mess with her! Such purpose in her stride - it offers a huge amount of dynamism to the image - at first glance the image almost appears to move. Of course, your nailed focus, with this depth of field, helps isolate your subject make our eyes snap to attention - I think this active pulling of the gaze enhances the feeling of a real moment.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: No<br/> <br/>Overall: Top class street candid.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Astonishing portrait. I wouldn''t want to mess with her! Such purpose in her stride - it offers a huge amount of dynamism to the image - at first glance the image almost appears to move. Of course, your nailed focus, with this depth of field, helps isolate your subject make our eyes snap to attention - I think this active pulling of the gaze enhances the feeling of a real moment. Critical stuff: No Overall: Top class street candid.', '2012-10-06 11:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876976, 1034969, 123208, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. Although I find the "lines" on the beach a little distracting and somehow draw the eye towards them after a while, I love the contrasting colours and the composition. Great!</td>', 'Lovely image. Although I find the "lines" on the beach a little distracting and somehow draw the eye towards them after a while, I love the contrasting colours and the composition. Great!', '2012-10-06 11:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876985, 1035520, 58430, '<td valign="top">This looks like a Bear image.<br/> <br/>I''m loving the foreground.</td>', 'This looks like a Bear image. I''m loving the foreground.', '2012-10-06 12:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876991, 1034547, 42495, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is setup or not, but either way quite convincing.</td>', 'Not sure if this is setup or not, but either way quite convincing.', '2012-10-06 12:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876992, 1035707, 42495, '<td valign="top">I love the minimalism.</td>', 'I love the minimalism.', '2012-10-06 12:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876994, 1035054, 42495, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  You pushed the processing to just the right point to create the atmosphere without overdoing it.  One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'Very nice.  You pushed the processing to just the right point to create the atmosphere without overdoing it.  One of my favorites so far.', '2012-10-06 12:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876995, 1035326, 42495, '<td valign="top">Overall I like it, but there''s just something unsettling in the catchlights.</td>', 'Overall I like it, but there''s just something unsettling in the catchlights.', '2012-10-06 12:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876996, 1035602, 42495, '<td valign="top">This one held my attention for a long time. Well done.</td>', 'This one held my attention for a long time. Well done.', '2012-10-06 12:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876997, 1035487, 42495, '<td valign="top">I was there about 20 years ago and this is exactly how I remember it.  Was this that "park" you had to pay to get in and drive through?</td>', 'I was there about 20 years ago and this is exactly how I remember it.  Was this that "park" you had to pay to get in and drive through?', '2012-10-06 12:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6876999, 1033635, 42495, '<td valign="top">Eye candy for sure, but it sure works.  A big print of this would look great on a wall.</td>', 'Eye candy for sure, but it sure works.  A big print of this would look great on a wall.', '2012-10-06 12:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877001, 1035713, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the young girl and old couple.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the young girl and old couple.', '2012-10-06 12:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877029, 1035602, 144365, '<td valign="top">It''ll be curious to see how bad this one does. <br/>You need to spend more than two seconds looking at it to realize its potential, and that''s going to be its downfall.</td>', 'It''ll be curious to see how bad this one does. You need to spend more than two seconds looking at it to realize its potential, and that''s going to be its downfall.', '2012-10-06 14:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877034, 1035703, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice progression/arrangement. Peaceful.</td>', 'Nice progression/arrangement. Peaceful.', '2012-10-06 14:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877035, 1035812, 76335, '<td valign="top">Oppressively so. Lovely details. Very nice.</td>', 'Oppressively so. Lovely details. Very nice.', '2012-10-06 14:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877036, 1035747, 76335, '<td valign="top">It would be less fun if it were in focus. Perfect.</td>', 'It would be less fun if it were in focus. Perfect.', '2012-10-06 14:57:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6877037, 1034960, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice softness and grain.</td>', 'Nice softness and grain.', '2012-10-06 14:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877038, 1035673, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the wide angle and various degrees of tilt.</td>', 'I like the wide angle and various degrees of tilt.', '2012-10-06 14:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877042, 1035706, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the tilt or the horizon right above her head which gives it a sinking feeling. She has a lovely smile.</td>', 'Not sure about the tilt or the horizon right above her head which gives it a sinking feeling. She has a lovely smile.', '2012-10-06 15:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877043, 1034603, 76335, '<td valign="top">Devil may care. Very good.</td>', 'Devil may care. Very good.', '2012-10-06 15:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877044, 1035146, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the colors seem too strong.</td>', 'Nice composition but the colors seem too strong.', '2012-10-06 15:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877045, 1035682, 76335, '<td valign="top">And in black and white, it''s just about perfect.</td>', 'And in black and white, it''s just about perfect.', '2012-10-06 15:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877047, 1034884, 76335, '<td valign="top">The various strides and postures are perfect for this high angle.</td>', 'The various strides and postures are perfect for this high angle.', '2012-10-06 15:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877048, 1032609, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lovely monochrome bokeh.</td>', 'Lovely monochrome bokeh.', '2012-10-06 15:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877049, 1034602, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice layering and cool tones. And I love that it''s peopleless.</td>', 'Nice layering and cool tones. And I love that it''s peopleless.', '2012-10-06 15:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877050, 1035542, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I don''t want to know. Nicely caught whatever the circumstances.</td>', 'I''m sure I don''t want to know. Nicely caught whatever the circumstances.', '2012-10-06 15:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877051, 1035790, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nice pouting. Are those "got milk?" lips or specular highlights?</td>', 'Nice pouting. Are those "got milk?" lips or specular highlights?', '2012-10-06 15:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877052, 1035494, 76335, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Is that a plane? I only wish it were closer or more easily discernible.</td>', 'Excellent. Is that a plane? I only wish it were closer or more easily discernible.', '2012-10-06 15:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877054, 1035394, 76335, '<td valign="top">that particular wallpaper was an inspired touch.</td>', 'that particular wallpaper was an inspired touch.', '2012-10-06 15:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877055, 1035525, 76335, '<td valign="top">Love how the cloud and water give the scene a claustrophobic feel.</td>', 'Love how the cloud and water give the scene a claustrophobic feel.', '2012-10-06 15:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877057, 1035305, 76335, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.</td>', 'Excellent composition.', '2012-10-06 15:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877059, 1035539, 10785, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft, hazy landscape here. Compositionally, the trail is leading me away from the spot where I want to look, which is over at the houses where all the detail is. The focal point of the image at the end of the trail is brightly lit but doesn''t have much detail to look at. Overall, I think the scene is underexposed.</td>', 'I really like the soft, hazy landscape here. Compositionally, the trail is leading me away from the spot where I want to look, which is over at the houses where all the detail is. The focal point of the image at the end of the trail is brightly lit but doesn''t have much detail to look at. Overall, I think the scene is underexposed.', '2012-10-06 15:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877060, 1035366, 10785, '<td valign="top">The sparks are bright and interesting, but there is not much else to add interest.</td>', 'The sparks are bright and interesting, but there is not much else to add interest.', '2012-10-06 15:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877061, 1035298, 10785, '<td valign="top">Lovely color, but not quite enough shadow in the lighting.</td>', 'Lovely color, but not quite enough shadow in the lighting.', '2012-10-06 15:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877090, 1035501, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good stop action, great fun.</td>', 'Good stop action, great fun.', '2012-10-06 17:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877091, 1034595, 76335, '<td valign="top">Love how the white cloud sails melodically over the trees.</td>', 'Love how the white cloud sails melodically over the trees.', '2012-10-06 17:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877092, 1035193, 76335, '<td valign="top">So unexpected. So good.</td>', 'So unexpected. So good.', '2012-10-06 17:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877093, 1034204, 76335, '<td valign="top">Outstanding.</td>', 'Outstanding.', '2012-10-06 17:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877094, 1032929, 76335, '<td valign="top">Love all the twists and turns.</td>', 'Love all the twists and turns.', '2012-10-06 17:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877100, 1035520, 18367, '<td valign="top">Great image, good focus and perspective.  I could be wrong, but the horizon seems ever so slightly slanted to the right.<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great image, good focus and perspective.  I could be wrong, but the horizon seems ever so slightly slanted to the right. Good luck in the challenge.', '2012-10-06 17:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877102, 1035492, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the pic, but I think more contrast would have helped.</td>', 'I like the pic, but I think more contrast would have helped.', '2012-10-06 17:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877104, 1032507, 103032, '<td valign="top">Really like how the boy(?) is blurred.  Like the footprints, like the rough waves, clouds are dynamic.  Cool pic.</td>', 'Really like how the boy(?) is blurred.  Like the footprints, like the rough waves, clouds are dynamic.  Cool pic.', '2012-10-06 18:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877124, 1035830, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the backlighting and the DOF here.  Not sure if the angle is too high above her, but something in the viewpoint seems awkward.  The pose looks a little stiff as her smile is not very natural.</td>', 'I like the backlighting and the DOF here.  Not sure if the angle is too high above her, but something in the viewpoint seems awkward.  The pose looks a little stiff as her smile is not very natural.', '2012-10-06 18:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877125, 1035027, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice captured momemnt.  The vignette is a little over the top.  Perhaps a tigher zoom might have more impact as there are so many shapes and colors fighting for the viewers attention.</td>', 'Nice captured momemnt.  The vignette is a little over the top.  Perhaps a tigher zoom might have more impact as there are so many shapes and colors fighting for the viewers attention.', '2012-10-06 18:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877126, 1034756, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen.  The square crop works very well here.  Not sure I would have picked white for the border.  I think black would have let your subject standout more.</td>', 'Nicely seen.  The square crop works very well here.  Not sure I would have picked white for the border.  I think black would have let your subject standout more.', '2012-10-06 18:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877127, 1032844, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very interseting composition.  The jagged white highlights are both interesting and offputting at the same time.  They are as much the subject as the Dragonfly is and therefore compete with him.</td>', 'Very interseting composition.  The jagged white highlights are both interesting and offputting at the same time.  They are as much the subject as the Dragonfly is and therefore compete with him.', '2012-10-06 18:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877129, 1035550, 91496, '<td valign="top">Photographs of a collage of photos are hard to judge.  I like the framing of the top row.  By cutting the heads off you have added to the "art" of the collage.  The bottom row does not work so well.  The border is a big distraction.  A simple thin black one would have worked better.</td>', 'Photographs of a collage of photos are hard to judge.  I like the framing of the top row.  By cutting the heads off you have added to the "art" of the collage.  The bottom row does not work so well.  The border is a big distraction.  A simple thin black one would have worked better.', '2012-10-06 18:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877130, 1035758, 91496, '<td valign="top">Interestng composiiton choice, including so mcuh foreground and sky.  It does not work for me.  They are pretty girls after all and are really form a small a part of the image.</td>', 'Interestng composiiton choice, including so mcuh foreground and sky.  It does not work for me.  They are pretty girls after all and are really form a small a part of the image.', '2012-10-06 18:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877131, 1035274, 91496, '<td valign="top">Lovely image with such a serene feeling.  I might panel it a little and crop off half of the OOF area at the bottom.</td>', 'Lovely image with such a serene feeling.  I might panel it a little and crop off half of the OOF area at the bottom.', '2012-10-06 18:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877133, 1034673, 91496, '<td valign="top">The sky is very powerful with great colors and clouds.  The airport is kind of blah and adds little to the image.</td>', 'The sky is very powerful with great colors and clouds.  The airport is kind of blah and adds little to the image.', '2012-10-06 18:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877134, 1034682, 91496, '<td valign="top">Well seen.  The triple of the figure/shadow/reflection is great.  Love the line of foam in the surf.  Vignette is a tad too strong.</td>', 'Well seen.  The triple of the figure/shadow/reflection is great.  Love the line of foam in the surf.  Vignette is a tad too strong.', '2012-10-06 19:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877135, 1035602, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love the lines and form of this one.  The DOF works well for the 2nd figure.  Nicely seen and shot.</td>', 'Love the lines and form of this one.  The DOF works well for the 2nd figure.  Nicely seen and shot.', '2012-10-06 19:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877137, 1035526, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the barn.  Sky tones are a bit out of place  with the rest of the image (too much HDR maybe.</td>', 'I like the texture of the barn.  Sky tones are a bit out of place  with the rest of the image (too much HDR maybe.', '2012-10-06 19:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877140, 1035704, 91496, '<td valign="top">The processing here kind of, almost, maybe works.  Or not.  Just seems too much.  I applaud the effort however, as we need to try new things to keep our edge.</td>', 'The processing here kind of, almost, maybe works.  Or not.  Just seems too much.  I applaud the effort however, as we need to try new things to keep our edge.', '2012-10-06 19:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877142, 1034749, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great colors in the sky and on the masts.  Border is a bit much.  I simple thin black border would have accented this nicely.</td>', 'Great colors in the sky and on the masts.  Border is a bit much.  I simple thin black border would have accented this nicely.', '2012-10-06 19:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877146, 1035713, 91496, '<td valign="top">The couple on the left works for me as they tell a story.  The women on the right seems to be looking right at you and the story is now about you the photographer.  Maybe a crop to just the couple would be a more powerful image.</td>', 'The couple on the left works for me as they tell a story.  The women on the right seems to be looking right at you and the story is now about you the photographer.  Maybe a crop to just the couple would be a more powerful image.', '2012-10-06 19:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877147, 1035533, 91496, '<td valign="top">Strange title since the leaves are incidental to the image.  I think the left half and right half are two differnet photos that stand alone better than they do together.</td>', 'Strange title since the leaves are incidental to the image.  I think the left half and right half are two differnet photos that stand alone better than they do together.', '2012-10-06 19:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877148, 1032929, 91496, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You found a composition where the power lines enhance and image rather than detract.  This is a very powerful with leading lines to everything.</td>', 'Wow.  You found a composition where the power lines enhance and image rather than detract.  This is a very powerful with leading lines to everything.', '2012-10-06 19:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877149, 1035707, 91496, '<td valign="top">I can see this selling for $40 Million and folks on the internet argueing about its value as art or as a photograph.  The tones here are great and really allow you to explore the image.  I might try it without the vignette as it creates the only "dark" area and my eyes keep resting in the dark lower corners.</td>', 'I can see this selling for $40 Million and folks on the internet argueing about its value as art or as a photograph.  The tones here are great and really allow you to explore the image.  I might try it without the vignette as it creates the only "dark" area and my eyes keep resting in the dark lower corners.', '2012-10-06 19:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877150, 1035577, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nicely seen and taken.  I wish this was in my portfolio.  All the elements work and clash and work again.  Slight halo effect on poles is the only minor negative.</td>', 'Nicely seen and taken.  I wish this was in my portfolio.  All the elements work and clash and work again.  Slight halo effect on poles is the only minor negative.', '2012-10-06 19:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877153, 1035404, 91496, '<td valign="top">Like the color and texture here.  I like that 3 sides are dark and the 4th light as it draws teh view to that side which is where the seat it.</td>', 'Like the color and texture here.  I like that 3 sides are dark and the 4th light as it draws teh view to that side which is where the seat it.', '2012-10-06 19:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
