(6877159, 1035841, 91496, '<td valign="top">I can see what you were going for here, but it does not really work for me. I have no connection to her and the nudity, ropes, and title do not convey any real meaning to me.</td>', 'I can see what you were going for here, but it does not really work for me. I have no connection to her and the nudity, ropes, and title do not convey any real meaning to me.', '2012-10-06 19:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877160, 1035428, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cute.  I wonder if you could have moved to the left and made the goat larger and just slightly more central.  Without the title I almost missed him wiht all the other details to look at.</td>', 'Cute.  I wonder if you could have moved to the left and made the goat larger and just slightly more central.  Without the title I almost missed him wiht all the other details to look at.', '2012-10-06 19:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877161, 1035552, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  What an expression on his face.  All the power in this image is the right two cats.  You may want to crop tight in on the both of them and tell the back one to open his eyes next time :)</td>', 'Great capture.  What an expression on his face.  All the power in this image is the right two cats.  You may want to crop tight in on the both of them and tell the back one to open his eyes next time :)', '2012-10-06 19:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877163, 1035305, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like all the negative space here, although perahps there is too much.    Think about it, your border is 100''s of times larger than your two subjects.  Maybe there is "tension" present but they are so small not sure I can tell.  Title it "Lost" or "We are alone" or somesuch and it might work better.</td>', 'I like all the negative space here, although perahps there is too much.    Think about it, your border is 100''s of times larger than your two subjects.  Maybe there is "tension" present but they are so small not sure I can tell.  Title it "Lost" or "We are alone" or somesuch and it might work better.', '2012-10-06 19:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
