(6877166, 1035540, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great.  I like all the negative space.  The man transforms the images from a bunch of cool shapes to something that has a story.  Very cool.</td>', 'Great.  I like all the negative space.  The man transforms the images from a bunch of cool shapes to something that has a story.  Very cool.', '2012-10-06 19:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
