(6877677, 1035428, 67152, '<td valign="top">What a capture!  You were at the right place at the right time. Well done.<br/> <br/>There are some small processing issues that may cost you some score (the edge of the sky near the mountains has a very noticeable halo and the goat is blown out) but I still think it is worth a 7.</td>', 'What a capture!  You were at the right place at the right time. Well done. There are some small processing issues that may cost you some score (the edge of the sky near the mountains has a very noticeable halo and the goat is blown out) but I still think it is worth a 7.', '2012-10-07 16:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6877685, 1035426, 20799, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The portrayed life, elegance and trust reminds me of one of Lev''s creations. The badge is such a nice element, unlike the watch - I almost wish he wasn''t wearing it. 10, absolutely.</td>', 'Beautiful. The portrayed life, elegance and trust reminds me of one of Lev''s creations. The badge is such a nice element, unlike the watch - I almost wish he wasn''t wearing it. 10, absolutely.', '2012-10-07 16:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
