(6877721, 1035822, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Ha! I love dogs and this one looks a bit special - just look at those eyes! Your eclectic partial framing is a masterstroke, Thelma''s personality holds centre stage. I really like the hot yellows top left and the colour and light more generally too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: No.<br/> <br/>Overall: Great dog shot.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Ha! I love dogs and this one looks a bit special - just look at those eyes! Your eclectic partial framing is a masterstroke, Thelma''s personality holds centre stage. I really like the hot yellows top left and the colour and light more generally too. Critical stuff: No. Overall: Great dog shot.', '2012-10-07 17:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
