(6877728, 1035682, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Wow, an explosion of pigeons - the chaos is palpable, i can almost hear the thumps of their wings. Took me a while to see the people, that then becomes a delightful ''aha'' moment.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: The lack of vertical verticals hurts this a little, though I understand (and would support) the decision to keep in the family rather than straighten the image.<br/> <br/>Overall: Very nice indeed.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Wow, an explosion of pigeons - the chaos is palpable, i can almost hear the thumps of their wings. Took me a while to see the people, that then becomes a delightful ''aha'' moment. Critical stuff: The lack of vertical verticals hurts this a little, though I understand (and would support) the decision to keep in the family rather than straighten the image. Overall: Very nice indeed.', '2012-10-07 17:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
