(6877815, 1035707, 10785, '<td valign="top">I love photo impressionism and you definitely have the start of something here. Unfortunately the frame is all background. You really need one more compositional element in the abstract image for it to pop. I can envision a big red OOF buoy out on the sea! Perhaps you can add a pop of color to this by hand in PS with a big, soft brush and make yourself a nice piece of wall art.</td>', 'I love photo impressionism and you definitely have the start of something here. Unfortunately the frame is all background. You really need one more compositional element in the abstract image for it to pop. I can envision a big red OOF buoy out on the sea! Perhaps you can add a pop of color to this by hand in PS with a big, soft brush and make yourself a nice piece of wall art.', '2012-10-07 19:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
