(6878362, 1035709, 47316, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mariuca:</b></div><hr/><i> Ha! I thought that no one knew of Merindol! Stayed there for a blessed summer but never met this man. Glad to see him now. Le bonhomme de Merindol. Can picture him now playing on the collines <br/>up </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I didn''t until this day! A friend of mine from Marseille was there helping at an eco festival so we went to visit him. There was an open music section with a piano, guitar, drums and accordions. It was mostly just kids banging around until this man picked up the accordion and started playing for us all. It was quite nice.</td>', 'Originally posted by mariuca: Ha! I thought that no one knew of Merindol! Stayed there for a blessed summer but never met this man. Glad to see him now. Le bonhomme de Merindol. Can picture him now playing on the collines up   I didn''t until this day! A friend of mine from Marseille was there helping at an eco festival so we went to visit him. There was an open music section with a piano, guitar, drums and accordions. It was mostly just kids banging around until this man picked up the accordion and started playing for us all. It was quite nice.', '2012-10-08 08:29:15.000000', NULL, 0),
