(6878403, 1035706, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the processing and the light is excellent. However, the composition doesn''t utilize the best features of this model, the long torso, to the advantage of the final product. Perhaps a wider shot would allow the viewer to take in more of the model, without, as it is now, bouncing from her compelling face and eyes down to the hand and belt and then back again, never allowing focus or rest. A bit more of the scene and this would highlight more of the strengths of your image.</td>', 'I like the processing and the light is excellent. However, the composition doesn''t utilize the best features of this model, the long torso, to the advantage of the final product. Perhaps a wider shot would allow the viewer to take in more of the model, without, as it is now, bouncing from her compelling face and eyes down to the hand and belt and then back again, never allowing focus or rest. A bit more of the scene and this would highlight more of the strengths of your image.', '2012-10-08 10:14:26.000000', NULL, 0),
