(6878611, 1035454, 60173, '<td valign="top">Instantly when I saw this photo it reminded me of one I put in a Freestudy a couple years ago. Yours has an interesting, classic portrait feel to it with a nice distant stare. Mine? It''s pretty silly, but the quality is still there (I think anyway)... <br/> <br/>Yours scores a 6.6, and mind scored a 5.9. I''d be curious what people think is the reason for the .7 difference.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=843301" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1136/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_843301.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1136/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_843301.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1136/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_843301.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Instantly when I saw this photo it reminded me of one I put in a Freestudy a couple years ago. Yours has an interesting, classic portrait feel to it with a nice distant stare. Mine? It''s pretty silly, but the quality is still there (I think anyway)...  Yours scores a 6.6, and mind scored a 5.9. I''d be curious what people think is the reason for the .7 difference. ', '2012-10-08 14:00:18.000000', NULL, 0),
