(6878633, 1035430, 96751, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tiny:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by herfotoman:</b></div><hr/><i> Definitely a paid actor in a setup shot. Therefore I''m not jealous. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yea I think John wanders the street with pockets full of money.........its the only way. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Actually, it''s his studio. There is no such real place that is this charming and full of such marvelous characters who happen to stand in perfect pockets of light.<br/> <br/>Congrats on the HM, John. Love this guy.</td>', 'Originally posted by Tiny: Originally posted by herfotoman: Definitely a paid actor in a setup shot. Therefore I''m not jealous.   Yea I think John wanders the street with pockets full of money.........its the only way.   Actually, it''s his studio. There is no such real place that is this charming and full of such marvelous characters who happen to stand in perfect pockets of light. Congrats on the HM, John. Love this guy.', '2012-10-08 14:16:47.000000', NULL, 0),
