(6878717, 1035118, 53094, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo!  I really like your processing, and think B&amp;W conversion was a good choice.</td>', 'This is a great photo!  I really like your processing, and think B&W conversion was a good choice.', '2012-10-08 15:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878724, 1035552, 11854, '<td valign="top">First image entered and a blue ribbon! Congrats! It''s truly a stunning image.</td>', 'First image entered and a blue ribbon! Congrats! It''s truly a stunning image.', '2012-10-08 15:40:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878725, 1035552, 20799, '<td valign="top">Great start! Congrats on the well deserved blue, what an amazing image!</td>', 'Great start! Congrats on the well deserved blue, what an amazing image!', '2012-10-08 15:41:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878730, 1035403, 30214, '<td valign="top">wonderful portrait</td>', 'wonderful portrait', '2012-10-08 15:45:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878734, 1035274, 20799, '<td valign="top">A perfect image to come back with! Beautiful scene and processing, love the whites... it''s one of those images I''ve always wanted to make, so it was an easy 10. Good to see you again!<br/>LOL grey band of blah? :)) still I think it works here.</td>', 'A perfect image to come back with! Beautiful scene and processing, love the whites... it''s one of those images I''ve always wanted to make, so it was an easy 10. Good to see you again!LOL grey band of blah? :)) still I think it works here.', '2012-10-08 15:49:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878736, 1033884, 20799, '<td valign="top">Great image, one of my favorites!</td>', 'Great image, one of my favorites!', '2012-10-08 15:50:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878739, 1035426, 20799, '<td valign="top">Way underrated, is all I can say.</td>', 'Way underrated, is all I can say.', '2012-10-08 15:53:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878742, 1035725, 68504, '<td valign="top">I was going to say "vintage bvy" before I even saw herfotoman''s variant.<br/> <br/>Paul''s comment almost restores my faith ...</td>', 'I was going to say "vintage bvy" before I even saw herfotoman''s variant. Paul''s comment almost restores my faith ...', '2012-10-08 15:57:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878746, 1034422, 1031, '<td valign="top">Since your "subject" is a (fairly) well-known and dynamic feature, I think you might have done better with a tighter crop.<br/> <br/>The lighting seems a little odd, like it can''t decide between gloomy overcast or partly-sunny. If I were to try re-editing (starting from where it is now) I''d probably try and boost the contrast with an "S"-shaped Curve on the RGB Channel, and maybe try and boost the blue in the sky/sea and the yellows in the land with a separate Curve on the Blue Channel.<br/> <br/>You might also try using the "high-radius UnSharp Mask" technique -- I find it helps make a landscape "pop" a little more ... for a DPC entry-sized image try using the UnSharp Mask filter at 15% | 50 px radius | Threshold = 0</td>', 'Since your "subject" is a (fairly) well-known and dynamic feature, I think you might have done better with a tighter crop. The lighting seems a little odd, like it can''t decide between gloomy overcast or partly-sunny. If I were to try re-editing (starting from where it is now) I''d probably try and boost the contrast with an "S"-shaped Curve on the RGB Channel, and maybe try and boost the blue in the sky/sea and the yellows in the land with a separate Curve on the Blue Channel. You might also try using the "high-radius UnSharp Mask" technique -- I find it helps make a landscape "pop" a little more ... for a DPC entry-sized image try using the UnSharp Mask filter at 15% | 50 px radius | Threshold = 0', '2012-10-08 15:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878760, 1035104, 68504, '<td valign="top">really to the point.</td>', 'really to the point.', '2012-10-08 16:12:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878764, 1035348, 68504, '<td valign="top">where are your tens? wish I had voted.  this is powerful. couldn''t agree more with blindj, Paul and bvy.</td>', 'where are your tens? wish I had voted.  this is powerful. couldn''t agree more with blindj, Paul and bvy.', '2012-10-08 16:15:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878773, 1035038, 92577, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the result and a new PB - fabulous image.</td>', 'Congrats on the result and a new PB - fabulous image.', '2012-10-08 16:27:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878778, 1035552, 92577, '<td valign="top">Seems we''re all in agreement then. Fantastic!</td>', 'Seems we''re all in agreement then. Fantastic!', '2012-10-08 16:30:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878785, 1035602, 20799, '<td valign="top">I guess Venser was right. It''s such a beautiful elegant image deserving a longer look. Only then can I see a touch of melancholy, some motion, a story. <br/>It''s just perfect the way it is. Thank you for sharing.</td>', 'I guess Venser was right. It''s such a beautiful elegant image deserving a longer look. Only then can I see a touch of melancholy, some motion, a story. It''s just perfect the way it is. Thank you for sharing.', '2012-10-08 16:41:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878796, 1035398, 20799, '<td valign="top">Interesting how you used somewhat flat tones to eliminate the unwanted and make us look at exactly what you intended to. <br/>I guess I didn''t look at it long enough during voting. It''s such a lovely projection of the curve into straight lines.</td>', 'Interesting how you used somewhat flat tones to eliminate the unwanted and make us look at exactly what you intended to. I guess I didn''t look at it long enough during voting. It''s such a lovely projection of the curve into straight lines.', '2012-10-08 16:47:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878829, 1035038, 108069, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot for sharing the original. This is an impressive example of excellent processing. Not that your original image wasn''t special, but you''ve really found the essence in it and displayed it at maximum potential. Very well done.<br/> <br/>And of course congratulations on the ribbon... your first? Hard to believe.</td>', 'Thanks a lot for sharing the original. This is an impressive example of excellent processing. Not that your original image wasn''t special, but you''ve really found the essence in it and displayed it at maximum potential. Very well done. And of course congratulations on the ribbon... your first? Hard to believe.', '2012-10-08 17:06:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878833, 1035548, 121362, '<td valign="top">Thank you for votes and comments, got higher score then I expected! :)<br/> <br/>Yes i know of all the flaws but this was not an easy task.<br/>The water moving on, ca 22 m/s so the only way in the dark was to heavily underexpose and do the rest in PS, (noise and detail nightmare)<br/> <br/>To do this properly i guess iso 12800 and F/1.4 would do the trick but that is a little out of my D90 reach ;)<br/> <br/>Yes I will try this again, but even her in Iceland, this is not <br/>a everyday view :)</td>', 'Thank you for votes and comments, got higher score then I expected! :) Yes i know of all the flaws but this was not an easy task.The water moving on, ca 22 m/s so the only way in the dark was to heavily underexpose and do the rest in PS, (noise and detail nightmare) To do this properly i guess iso 12800 and F/1.4 would do the trick but that is a little out of my D90 reach ;) Yes I will try this again, but even her in Iceland, this is not a everyday view :)', '2012-10-08 17:10:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6878847, 1033635, 152941, '<td valign="top">this has to be one of my favorite shots ive seen...i really like this...</td>', 'this has to be one of my favorite shots ive seen...i really like this...', '2012-10-08 17:17:32.000000', NULL, 0),
