(6879306, 1035552, 59029, '<td valign="top">What an amazing capture of some of my favourite big cats.  Huge congrats on your first blue on your first entry, and welcome to DPC!!! :-)<br/> <br/>ETA: Looking at the artefacts, and considering you''re in Africa, wouldn''t it be heat haze plus a bit of compression?  I know I get similar results with my 300 and even more with the TC on.  Tack-sharp within the dof but beyond that, usually soft.  And I''ve taken shots in the dead of winter, of birds on the ground, and there is still heat haze!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-10-09 07:57:50.</i></td>', 'What an amazing capture of some of my favourite big cats.  Huge congrats on your first blue on your first entry, and welcome to DPC!!! :-) ETA: Looking at the artefacts, and considering you''re in Africa, wouldn''t it be heat haze plus a bit of compression?  I know I get similar results with my 300 and even more with the TC on.  Tack-sharp within the dof but beyond that, usually soft.  And I''ve taken shots in the dead of winter, of birds on the ground, and there is still heat haze!', '2012-10-09 08:53:29.000000', '2012-10-09 08:57:50.000000', 0),
(6879307, 1033635, 59029, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous shot, looks like a scene from an Indiana Jones movie before giant boulders start rolling :-)  Huge congrats on the red, and Siggy says hi!</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous shot, looks like a scene from an Indiana Jones movie before giant boulders start rolling :-)  Huge congrats on the red, and Siggy says hi!', '2012-10-09 08:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
