(6880200, 1033713, 100393, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> outstanding<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m not surprised this resonated with Don, when I viewed it your image made me think of this shot of his:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=921804" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1303/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_921804.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1303/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_921804.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1303/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_921804.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: outstanding Posthumous Red Ribbon    I''m not surprised this resonated with Don, when I viewed it your image made me think of this shot of his: ', '2012-10-10 09:34:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6880248, 1034547, 2058, '<td valign="top">No setup involved here, and I don''t know if the lady saw me or not.  I was visiting Sorrento on a cruise, saw this woman and her kids sitting on the steps, and managed to sneak a couple photos.  I did feel bad afterwards and thought I should have gone back and given her some money.  There were a LOT of shoppers on the street so that''s why she was probably holding her hand out.  But I thought this was a pretty powerful image so I wasn''t going to delete it, and figured when I got back I''d share it here, and maybe see how well it scored.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments!</td>', 'No setup involved here, and I don''t know if the lady saw me or not.  I was visiting Sorrento on a cruise, saw this woman and her kids sitting on the steps, and managed to sneak a couple photos.  I did feel bad afterwards and thought I should have gone back and given her some money.  There were a LOT of shoppers on the street so that''s why she was probably holding her hand out.  But I thought this was a pretty powerful image so I wasn''t going to delete it, and figured when I got back I''d share it here, and maybe see how well it scored. Thanks for the comments!', '2012-10-10 11:17:48.000000', NULL, 0),
