(6940251, 1035796, 10785, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Comment Bomb Squad!</b> <br/> <br/>I am just going through your portfolio finding those images that don''t have many comments and I happened upon this glowing gem of a young lady!<br/> <br/>I love the way you have posed her. She is very delicate and feminine looking. Only thing to even look at in the future is the position of her left hand on the block. I read somewhere that ladies should show off the side edge of their hands for feminimity. So have her turn that left hand 90 degrees. The hand over her leg is fine in my opinion. I think her eyes were brightened just a bit too much. Her skin is very well done, smooth and bright. I think the white balance is good. THis would be a good candidate for a nice vignette to bring the focal point right to her by darkening the edges a touch. Overall, well done!</td>', 'Greetings from the Comment Bomb Squad!  I am just going through your portfolio finding those images that don''t have many comments and I happened upon this glowing gem of a young lady! I love the way you have posed her. She is very delicate and feminine looking. Only thing to even look at in the future is the position of her left hand on the block. I read somewhere that ladies should show off the side edge of their hands for feminimity. So have her turn that left hand 90 degrees. The hand over her leg is fine in my opinion. I think her eyes were brightened just a bit too much. Her skin is very well done, smooth and bright. I think the white balance is good. THis would be a good candidate for a nice vignette to bring the focal point right to her by darkening the edges a touch. Overall, well done!', '2012-12-22 21:11:24.000000', NULL, 0),
