(6940730, 1035796, 117534, '<td valign="top">Thanks Guys for the input!  El-Roi excellent suggestion, will put that in my bag of notes!  How many of you can tell she''s 8 months pregnate... Yep Senior pix ... I was working hard to keep the belly hid. Sometimes I failed to pay attention to the important part of the shot for doing that!!</td>', 'Thanks Guys for the input!  El-Roi excellent suggestion, will put that in my bag of notes!  How many of you can tell she''s 8 months pregnate... Yep Senior pix ... I was working hard to keep the belly hid. Sometimes I failed to pay attention to the important part of the shot for doing that!!', '2012-12-23 13:43:15.000000', NULL, 0),
